      "topic": "sudo/timestamp-validation-flows",
      "category": "kernel-authority-absent",
      "reason": "The observable is produced by the real /dev/bashos-auth kernel authority (the cached credential that -k, -K and -v reset or validate lives in the authority); no guest kernel provides that device and a synthetic stand-in would not be the authority's answer."
    },
